  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0035, merged in PR #4181): dependency identity is N per-manifest nodes — the manifest path joins the stable_id hash — with aggregate views keyed by (ecosystem, name). The cross-manifest collapse here is exactly what the ruling forbids. Waits on the implementing fix."  # 677c
